new.append(('h','5.6. CPU follow-ups limit the next hypotheses'))
NP('CPU audit 028 tested whether player-relative own/opponent encoding explained the sender weakness. Adding player interactions did not improve any fixed raw color probe: sender check accuracy fell from 48/65 to 45/65 and expert-query accuracy from 39/65 to 35/65. A separate affine sender calibration 029 reduced occupancy BCE from 0.3371234 to 0.2849453 on the reused 65-board check, but correct cells fell from 4,317 to 4,102 out of 5,265. The reconstructed-logit approximation also required a separate runtime check. The patch was retained as a CPU tradeoff result and not rolled out on the full GPU model. Neither follow-up established a deployable fix.')
